# ...but a fixture repository's own docs/ folder is analyzer input, not a
# working folder of ours. Without this the deployment look-alike fixture
# loses the prose that is half of what it exists to test, and the tests
# over it pass on CI by finding nothing.
!tests/fixtures/repos/**/docs/
!tests/fixtures/repos/**/docs/**
